  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759830,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 16 Shot! - Shooting Watch for Nintendo 3DS\n\nRelive the arcade classic and challenge a legend in *16 Shot! - Shooting Watch* for Nintendo 3DS! Inspired by Hudson's iconic \"Master Higgins\" and his record-breaking 16 shots per second, this frantic, fast-paced shooter puts your reflexes to the ultimate test.\n\nStep into the shoes of a futuristic bounty hunter tasked with defending the galaxy from waves of relentless alien invaders. Utilizing the 3DS's stereoscopic 3D, experience a visually stunning and immersive battle as you dodge projectiles and unleash a blistering barrage of laser fire. \n\n*16 Shot!* features multiple game modes, including a classic arcade mode to chase the legendary 16 shots per second record, a challenging survival mode, and a unique \"watch mode\" that allows you to play on the 3DS system's clock face. Compete against friends locally, climb the online leaderboards, and prove you have what it takes to become the new Master! Prepare for a non-stop adrenaline rush!"
    },
